### Health check

GET {{InterviewSimulator.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### ── Auth ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Smoke test (requires authenticated session cookie)
GET {{InterviewSimulator.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/smoke
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

###

### Sign out
POST {{InterviewSimulator.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

###

### ── Interviews ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Create an interview session
# @name createInterview
POST {{InterviewSimulator.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interviews
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

{
  "targetRole": "Full Stack Engineer",
  "focusArea": "dotnet",
  "interviewType": "Technical",
  "seniorityLevel": "Senior",
  "questionCount": 3
}

###

@interviewId = {{createInterview.response.body.$.id}}

### 2. Get the created interview
GET {{InterviewSimulator.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interviews/{{interviewId}}
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

###

### 3. List all interviews
GET {{InterviewSimulator.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interviews
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

###

### 3a. List interviews filtered by status (created / active / completed)
GET {{InterviewSimulator.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interviews?status=created&status=active
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

###

### 4. Start the interview (generates first question)
POST {{InterviewSimulator.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interviews/{{interviewId}}/start
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

###

### 5. Submit answer for turn 1
POST {{InterviewSimulator.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interviews/{{interviewId}}/answers
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

{
  "turnNumber": 1,
  "answer": "I use async/await with ConfigureAwait(false) in library code and ensure all I/O operations are non-blocking. For CPU-bound work I offload to Task.Run."
}

###

### 5b. Submit answer for turn 2
POST {{InterviewSimulator.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interviews/{{interviewId}}/answers
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

{
  "turnNumber": 2,
  "answer": "I apply dependency injection and prefer constructor injection. For testability I code against interfaces and use fakes or in-memory implementations in tests."
}

###

### 5c. Submit answer for turn 3 (last turn — session moves to Completed after this)
POST {{InterviewSimulator.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interviews/{{interviewId}}/answers
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

{
  "turnNumber": 3,
  "answer": "I handle errors with a global exception handler and return RFC 9457 ProblemDetails responses. Domain errors are mapped to appropriate HTTP status codes."
}

###

### 6. Complete the interview explicitly (if not auto-completed)
POST {{InterviewSimulator.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interviews/{{interviewId}}/complete
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

###

### 7. Get the completed interview (check feedback/score once evaluation is wired)
GET {{InterviewSimulator.Api_HostAddress}}/api/interviews/{{interviewId}}
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{authCookie}}
